{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And you shall say to your servant, etc.</b> Meaning: corresponding to his saying ״לְמִי אַתָּה״ — the response is ״עַבְדְּךָ יַעֲקֹב״; corresponding to ״וְאָנָה תֵלֵךְ״ — to bring a gift, which is his saying ״מִנְחָה שְׁלוּחָה״; and corresponding to ״וּלְמִי״ — ״לַאדֹנִי לְעֵשָׂו״."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:45:36.256001345Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}